{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_dzxao6efmk3pnvyayuojjzxqk4wophkrubmcmanfrsyvu4p7nc4q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I understand the project. Let me analyze the C code to translate it to Rust.\n\nThe C function `leftpad`:\n1. Computes `str_len` (length of input string)\n2. If `padding` is NULL/empty, defaults to `\" \"`\n3. Computes `npad = max(0, min_len - str_len)`\n4. If `dest` is NULL or `dest_sz` is 0, returns required length (`str_len + npad`)\n5. Otherwise writes up to `dest_sz - 1` chars + null terminator. Padding is cycled through, and the C code uses a trick to skip the null terminator and reset to index 1.\n\nThe Rust signature uses `&str` (not nullable). The cycling is equivalent to `padding[i % padding.len()]`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1223,"cache_read_input_tokens":18461,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1223,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":37,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a9f183c-e816-4be5-ba96-4e4e177de90c","uuid":"284f1d61-d000-410d-aa2a-3c6d1c7d25c2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_dzxao6efmk3pnvyayuojjzxqk4wophkrubmcmanfrsyvu4p7nc4q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01YRQ9obUUcZphUyjhnba7BM","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-31062124/harvest-crust-qKUA0p/project/src/leftpad.rs","content":"// Function Declarations\npub fn leftpad(str: &str, padding: &str, min_len: usize, dest: &mut [u8]) -> usize {\n    let str_bytes = str.as_bytes();\n    let pad_bytes: &[u8] = if padding.is_empty() {\n        b\" \"\n    } else {\n        padding.as_bytes()\n    };\n\n    let str_len = str_bytes.len();\n    let npad = if str_len < min_len {\n        min_len - str_len\n    } else {\n        0\n    };\n\n    let dest_sz = dest.len();\n    if dest_sz == 0 {\n        return str_len + npad;\n    }\n\n    let pad_len = pad_bytes.len();\n    let mut dest_len: usize = 0;\n    let mut i: usize = 0;\n\n    while dest_len < npad && dest_len < dest_sz - 1 {\n        dest[dest_len] = pad_bytes[i % pad_len];\n        dest_len += 1;\n        i += 1;\n    }\n\n    let mut j: usize = 0;\n    while j < str_len && dest_len < dest_sz - 1 {\n        dest[dest_len] = str_bytes[j];\n        dest_len += 1;\n        j += 1;\n    }\n\n    dest[dest_len] = 0;\n\n    dest_len\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1223,"cache_read_input_tokens":18461,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1223,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":37,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a9f183c-e816-4be5-ba96-4e4e177de90c","uuid":"c491d7f0-5ed9-43bc-bd1a-06cbf6c43012"}
